    "directions": [
      "In a saucepan over medium heat, melt the sugar in the orange juice. Add the cranberries and cook over low heat for 10 minutes. Set aside and let it cool.",
      "Blend cranberries in a blender, then strain to make the puree",
      "In a shaker add crushed ice, 1 1/2 ounces of tequila, 1/2 ounce of Grand Marnier, 1 1/2 ounces of cranberry puree and shake to mix.",
      "Pour drink into a sugar-rimmed glass. Add a cranberry swizzle stick for garnish."
